["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"JD Vance on AI, Entitlement Fraud, Iran War, Israel, H-1B Abuse &amp; the Midterms SNAP NIMBY DOGE\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-allin-ai-前沿公司造了弗兰肯斯坦-却找政府要监管/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3ff4664d500d34f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">27:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>AI 前沿公司造了弗兰肯斯坦，却找政府要监管</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">万斯说，如果你在造弗兰肯斯坦，第一该停下来，第二当企业来要防御工具时得给他们——而不是把前沿公司自己造的风险外包给全球治理机构。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 监管</span><span class=\"tag\">H-1B</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Are Budget Airlines Facing Extinction? ULCC Basic Economy premiumization\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-wsjournal-廉价航空的对手不是同行-是卖里程的信用卡生意/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc66680f65b8e859-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">18:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Journal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>廉价航空的对手不是同行，是卖里程的信用卡生意</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">超低成本航空靠极致低价起家，如今被大航司的 Basic Economy 和常旅客信用卡夹击——后者让旅客愿意多花 100 美元只为攒积分，价格敏感型客户反而成了最不可靠的客户。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">航空业</span><span class=\"tag\">商业模式</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Balance of AI Power: Anton Leicht on Politics, Pacing Deals, and Muddling Through Well compute for access quasi vassalage SRO surveillance maxing muddle through\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-cogrev-暂停前沿开发对中国是笔好交易-所以美国不会接受/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f309d831f20dfbd2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:10:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>暂停前沿开发对中国是笔好交易，所以美国不会接受</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果暂停只覆盖前沿模型开发、不覆盖机器人、电力、半导体国产化这些赛道，中国就能把其余全部跑完，再在失去芯片优势的时点重启竞赛——这笔交易对美国明显不利。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>30</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 地缘政治</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Episode 199: Ken and Dawn respond to listener questions on aging, meat consumption and dementia, genetic testing, AI, exercise, a lunar mission and much more openweight APOE4 sarcopenia anabolic resistance bioelectrical impedance\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-stemtalk-近前沿模型开源后-闭源实验室的护城河还剩什么/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/48692e1482a92168-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">STEM-Talk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>近前沿模型开源后，闭源实验室的护城河还剩什么</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">如果中国开源模型几个月就能逼近美国闭源前沿，那么「我们模型最强」就不再是护城河，真正值钱的是生态、可靠性和工作流整合。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 护城河</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Satya Nadella on the AI Doomer Slowdown, Microsoft&#x27;s Master Plan &amp; Who Wins AI reward hacking capability overhang KV cache harness test time compute\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-allin-微软不追前沿模型-纳德拉说真正的生意是当所有人的中间层/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0dbdd0b5b0c7b4d6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">36:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>微软不追前沿模型：纳德拉说真正的生意是当所有人的中间层</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">前沿实验室在争谁造最强模型，纳德拉说微软要做的是让企业「用所有模型但独立于所有模型」——模型层的超额利润会被开源压掉，钱在应用和中间层。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业AI</span><span class=\"tag\">算力投资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"How Physical AI Learns Across Language, Video and Action — Ming-Yu Liu world model forward dynamics inverse dynamics sim-to-real gap embodiment temporal position embedding\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-mlst-世界模型不是预测未来-是给机器人做排名验证/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e10a54548d7f7f00-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">25:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ML Street Talk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>世界模型不是预测未来，是给机器人做排名验证</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Cosmos 3 把前向动力学、逆向动力学和策略塞进一个模型，但最先落地的不是训练，而是用神经模拟器给一堆 checkpoint 排名，筛掉大部分再上真机。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">世界模型</span><span class=\"tag\">机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Dark Matter Has a Problem. So Does MOND. MOND asymmetric drift external field effect baryonic mass kiloparsec\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-intotheimpossi-银河系外缘转慢了-暗物质和-mond-可能都预测错了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b19f96d3fdc2b6b9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">15:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Into the Impossible With Brian Keating</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>银河系外缘转慢了，暗物质和 MOND 可能都预测错了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">盖亚测出的银河系外缘旋转曲线像开普勒式下降，而暗物质晕和 MOND 都预期它保持平坦——两边都得靠调参数或外部场效应才能活下来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">天体物理</span><span class=\"tag\">暗物质</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jacob Weisberg on the Contagion of Cowardice Profiles in Courage PEPFAR vibe shift\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-goodfight-勇气和懦弱都会传染-哈佛硬扛成了转折点/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>勇气和懦弱都会传染，哈佛硬扛成了转折点</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">勇气不是个人品格，而是社会现象：人们看周围人怎么做。特朗普第二任期最大的变化，是身边人从抵抗变成了投降，而哈佛拒签协议让抵抗重新变得可能。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美国政治</span><span class=\"tag\">机构抵抗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Age of Body Futurism | Ruby Justice Thelot paracontent body futurism quantified self GLP-1 peptides\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-a16z-肽和-glp-1-的流行-其实不是硅谷发明的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">42:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>肽和 GLP-1 的流行，其实不是硅谷发明的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">肽文化先在德州和健美圈流行，才被硅谷专业化和加速；真正值得警惕的是「关于内容的内容」比内容本身还多，让人误判什么真的在发生。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费文化</span><span class=\"tag\">健康科技</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Tobi Lütke: AI Agents, Better Decisions, and the Future of Work skeuomorphism slop grenades Goodhart&#x27;s law refounding event\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-knowledge-ai-不能承担责任-所以-ceo-不会被替换/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/364b2175d897a9eb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>AI 不能承担责任，所以 CEO 不会被替换</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Tobi Lütke 说机器能帮你把判断的环境搭好，但机器不能坐牢、不能被追责。Shopify 一半的 PR 已由聊天频道里的 AI 同事 River 发起，而人类保留的只剩品味与判断。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI agent</span><span class=\"tag\">组织设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Let’s Kill Sh*t: Axios CEO on simplifying your work-life in the AI era post-processable velocity messy middle cognitive fatigue force multiplier table stakes\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-masterscale-ai-短期是复杂制造机-不是效率工具/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/df59dc4c1e43fb63-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">32:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Masters of Scale</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>AI 短期是复杂制造机，不是效率工具</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 让每个人都能写、能做研究，结果是更多邮件、更多演示、更多决定。Jim VandeHei 说，短期它制造复杂，只有主动删减才能拿回时间。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 效率</span><span class=\"tag\">组织管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"How to build a secure attachment with yourself: The connection between self-worth and parenting with Dr. Marisa G. Franco secureish self-verification theory memory reconsolidation covert avoidance mere exposure effect reflective functioning\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-secureattach-越想变安全-越不安全-安全型是能承认自己不安全/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ddcbe6658f0e30d7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">48:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Securely Attached</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>越想变安全，越不安全：安全型是能承认自己不安全</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">安全型不是没有焦虑、回避和嫉妒，而是能当这些情绪的安全容器。把不安全的部分推开，等于在自己身上重演当年让你不安全的批评与忽视。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">依恋理论</span><span class=\"tag\">自我价值</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Box&#x27;s Aaron Levie: On Reinventing Yourself in the AI Age and Enterprise Diffusion work slop harness continual learning open-weight model MCP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-trainingdata-模型是炼油厂-值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4f7ea15b23ee6f00-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:21</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Training Data</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>模型是炼油厂，值钱的是化工厂和汽车公司</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">商业史上第一波跑出来的公司几乎从不是下个阶段的赢家。模型公司是提炼基础油的炼油厂，真正值钱的是把智能接进银行、药企、政府工作流的应用层。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业AI</span><span class=\"tag\">应用层</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Doves Type Doves Type apologia photo-engraving\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-ninepi-他把整套铅字倒进泰晤士河-只为没人能用它/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e11e283634cdaaa8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"9\"><span class=\"dur\">37:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">99% Invisible</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>他把整套铅字倒进泰晤士河，只为没人能用它</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Thomas Cobden-Sanderson 用 173 个夜晚把 2600 磅 Doves Type 倒进泰晤士河，因为铅字是实物，倒掉就是独占。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">字体设计</span><span class=\"tag\">出版史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Special Episode: Dr. Alanna Skuse &amp; The Surgeon, The Midwife, The Quack humors apothecary quack mountebank uroscopy non-naturals\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-tpwky-文艺复兴的医生分四等-最会治病的却被叫庸医/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/360c7ded98e41886-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">52:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">This Podcast Will Kill You</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>文艺复兴的医生分四等，最会治病的却被叫庸医</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">骨接师每周赶集接骨，比一年做几例的正式外科医生更熟练，却被医生骂成庸医——头衔和本事从来不是一回事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">医学史</span><span class=\"tag\">文艺复兴</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"289: Signs Your Teen is Heading Towards an Eating Disorder | Dr. Kelly Bhatnagar Maudsley family-based treatment (FBT) body neutrality disordered eating\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-asklisa-孩子开始吃得健康-可能是进食障碍的起点/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e802a0f21fabf964-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">34:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Ask Lisa</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>孩子开始吃得健康，可能是进食障碍的起点</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">进食障碍靠保密存活，所以家长看到苗头就该说出口。孩子不会因此更糟，反而可能松一口气——因为终于有人替她做决定了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青少年心理</span><span class=\"tag\">进食障碍</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Don’t Let School Be the End of Play unstructured play downtime self-directed play\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-unruffled-上学不是玩的终点-自由玩耍反而更珍贵/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/1a571492f353e90a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">24:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Unruffled</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>上学不是玩的终点，自由玩耍反而更珍贵</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">孩子进入全日制学校后，独立、无结构的玩耍不是被取代，而是变得更稀缺、更重要——它是孩子消化学校刺激、发展创造力的核心途径。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">玩耍</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Connecting homes to the internet using cable TV coax cable signal-to-noise ratio royalty-free\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-witness-他放弃专利费-让美国家庭用有线电视上网/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4ad7b76f4c635f2c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"W\"><span class=\"dur\">10:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Witness History</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>他放弃专利费，让美国家庭用有线电视上网</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1991年，一个伊朗裔工程师用已有的同轴电缆让数据双向进出家庭，并把技术免版税捐给电信业成为全球标准——他本可以靠它赚几十亿。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">互联网史</span><span class=\"tag\">有线电视</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Elon Musk &amp; Gwynne Shotwell on AI Risks and Peer Review, Starship, Terafab, SpaceX/Tesla Merger test harness eval player coach direct-to-cell\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-allin-ai-巨头互相测试模型-比自建监管机构更可行/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f4dc045ca7baf461-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>AI 巨头互相测试模型，比自建监管机构更可行</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Elon 说 AI 危险是真的，但解法不是联合国式的监管机构，而是让竞争对手互相跑测试 harness——因为没人能给自己判卷，中国也只会接受这种不丢面子的方案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">SpaceX</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"ModelTalk: Pacing the Frontier pacing the frontier RSI open weights hill climb\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-15-chinatalk-ai-安全联盟突然成型-但没人知道怎么量-前沿/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d73b1da16568d412-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0915</span></div>\n<h2>AI 安全联盟突然成型，但没人知道怎么量「前沿」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Hugging Face 事件让左翼和 AI 安全派第一次合流，可「pacing the frontier」这个词本身就没法测量——没有立法，第三方评估只是自愿的善意。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">监管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"182.全球宏观和资本市场2026三季度复盘与展望：多重囚徒困境 CAPEX ROA carry trade hyperscaler 二阶导\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-cna29e88-美债利率逼近5-ai叙事为何还不破/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c7765283e8bf256a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"起\"><span class=\"dur\">1:39:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">起朱楼宴宾客</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>美债利率逼近5%，AI叙事为何还不破</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国资金越来越贵，AI却还在通胀，其他行业都在通缩。这个矛盾要么靠AI真突破把利率打下来，要么等它被证伪——但没人敢先慢下来。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宏观</span><span class=\"tag\">美债</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"The AI Slowdown Debate | Diet TBPN pacing the frontier PBC Sherman Antitrust Act Section 230 METER\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-tbpn-ai-减速之争-dario-的三步计划-sam-和-elon-都点了头/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c331d210a13011ec-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">25:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">TBPN</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>AI 减速之争：Dario 的三步计划，Sam 和 Elon 都点了头</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dario 周六早上发文要求「pace the frontier」，Sam 和 Elon 当天先后背书；但真正的新事实只有一个——OpenAI 和 Anthropic 将嵌入第三方评估者，而这一步可能需要先豁免反垄断法。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 监管</span><span class=\"tag\">pacing the frontier</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jensen Huang: The Doomer Hoax, Superintelligence Is Here, and The Future of AI (ft. President Trump) RSI LoRA NeoCloud land power shell hyperscaler\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-allin-黄仁勋-ai-末日论是编出来的-超级智能已经到了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/08e1dfbffee89d60-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">46:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>黄仁勋：AI 末日论是编出来的，超级智能已经到了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黄仁勋把前沿实验室的灭绝预测称为「编出来的」不负责任言论，并说超级智能不是未来时——在自动驾驶、蛋白质合成这些窄领域，它已经比人做得更好。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">开源模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Ep. 030 - Long Live the Short King: Why 4-HI HBM Wins (Memory) | Myron Xie, Jordan Nanos HBM 4-HI / 8-HI / 12-HI KV cache MXFP4 scale-up domain\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-14-semianalysiswe-英伟达旗舰-gpu-内存首次倒退-4-hi-hbm-为什么赢/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d3f66fbf6cfa27e9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">38:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">SemiAnalysis Weekly</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0914</span></div>\n<h2>英伟达旗舰 GPU 内存首次倒退：4-HI HBM 为什么赢</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Rubin Ultra 的 HBM 从承诺的 1TB 砍到 192GB，比现在出货的 288GB 还少。这不是技术退步，是 DRAM 短缺下的产能配给：4-HI 堆叠良率更高，能榨出两倍以上的 HBM cube。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">HBM</span>\n</div></div></a>"]